Z||000004||Greg Piet||11-22-1999||07:54 PM||||I have had a set of Metwrench for a number of years now.  I really like them, but there are a few times they cant be used.  For very tight spots they are hard to work with because they have a bit of slop since they grab the walls and not the corners.   <BR>||||reg||1
